{"id":"en_i-m-my-sister-s-fianc-s-hidden-love","title":"I’m My Sister’s Fiancé’s Hidden Love","titleEn":"I’m My Sister’s Fiancé’s Hidden Love","description":"After her rebirth, Elianna makes a striking choice: she trades husbands with her younger sister and weds Jesse, the eldest prince whose life ended prematurely. Her goal is simple and urgent—produce a prince and thereby safeguard her own survival. What she cannot know is that Jesse is a man of profound devotion who has spent two lifetimes seeking her out. As this new life unfolds, Elianna finds herself deflecting her sister's plots, and in the process she stumbles upon the real story behind Jesse's hidden love, upending the tangled conspiracies that have haunted both of their pasts. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/im-my-sisters-fiances-hidden-love/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/im-my-sisters-fiances-hidden-love/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mystery","Rebirth","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dig36/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-m-my-sister-s-fianc-s-hidden-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dig36/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-m-my-sister-s-fianc-s-hidden-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dig36/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-m-my-sister-s-fianc-s-hidden-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dig36/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"